ok - an absent record reads none, never a clean exit
ok - an armed-but-never-completed record reads as exit-not-recorded
ok - an exit status of 0 is recorded as a clean exit with no signal
ok - a signalled exit records the signal, its name, and the derivation it came from
ok - a nonzero non-signal exit is abnormal and claims no signal
ok - completing the record preserves the spawn-time snapshot it is compared against
ok - an exit is recorded even when the armed half is absent
ok - corrupt records read unreadable and never as a clean exit
ok - usage errors exit 2 and --help exits 0
